  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/ZoomUtils/refs/heads/main/logo.png\" alt=\"ZoomUtils\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/fweigel-dev/ZoomUtils\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/ZoomUtils/refs/heads/main/README/github_icon_bg.png\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fzoomutils\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/ZoomUtils/refs/heads/main/README/modrinth_icon_bg.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zoomutils\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/ZoomUtils/refs/heads/main/README/curseforge_icon_bg.png\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a>\n</p><div>\n  <div>\n    <h3 style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700\">支援版本：</h3>\n    <img width=\"165\" height=\"84\" alt=\"Minecraft 26.1\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/ZoomUtils/refs/heads/main/README/26.1.png\">\n    <img width=\"165\" height=\"84\" alt=\"Minecraft 26.2\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/ZoomUtils/refs/heads/main/README/26.2.png\">\n  </div>\n</div><p>流暢、可設定的縮放模組</p><hr><p>按住縮放按鍵（預設：<code>C</code>）即可放大。縮放時滾動滑鼠滾輪可調整縮放等級。放開按鍵即可恢復。</p>",
